cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. If you
  use the CLIPNET or ProCapNet models specifically, or the underlying BPNet
  architecture (via the bpnet-lite dependency), please also cite the
  corresponding paper listed under "references".
title: PersonalBPNet
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: He
    given-names: Adam Y.
    email: adamyhe@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/adamyhe/PersonalBPNet"
license: MIT
version: 0.7.0
references:
  - type: article
    title: Base-resolution models of transcription-factor binding reveal soft motif syntax
    authors:
      - family-names: Avsec
        given-names: Žiga
      - family-names: Weilert
        given-names: Melanie
